# HireHub Onboarding Portal - Environment Variables
# This is a client-side-only application. No environment variables are required to run.

# Vite exposes environment variables to client code using the VITE_ prefix.
# Only variables prefixed with VITE_ are available in the browser via import.meta.env.VITE_*
# See: https://vitejs.dev/guide/env-and-mode.html

# Example (uncomment and set if needed):
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:3000/api
# VITE_APP_TITLE=HireHub Onboarding Portal